      "jp": "落ち着いてください！\nそこまで言うならお魚は食べませんから！",
      "jp_sha256": "3e6192ad88438e3280b0f286bd6f540f5d4148a1f47a9748132b5dc23b26df0a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "진정하세요!\n그렇게까지 말한다면 물고기는 먹지 않을 테니까요!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b010-20261107-same-model-pass2-r1",
